ive about seizing opposition  journalists abroad  amid tensions over its tattered nuclear  deal  according to the indictment five critics  of the regime were targeted  i take it you're going to keep writing  oh yeah  i'm not gonna get i am not going to give  up if they arrest me or kill me  they cannot keep iranian people silent  who are fighting for freedom  we have reached out to the iranian  mission at the u.n for comment on these  charges and so far have not heard back  one of the five people indicted is in  custody the four who remain at large  could face  life in prison gail she's very brave  thank you and great hair and a bad house  too thank you jeff
 

